  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mahabama School is currently being built in Sierra Leone! Right now the building is at window height and this phase will take the building to roof height. Beyond that the roof will be built (phase 3), then it will be painted and doors, windows, and floors will be installed (phase 4), and finally desks, chalk boards, furniture will be moved in (phase 5).</narrative>
